{"brief": "为 Microduck 设计一个友好、有辨识度的头顶外观装饰件，具体视觉主题由你决定。保留原机器人和相机，不做尖锐或夸张笨重的造型。希望它作为个性化可打印原型展示；安装方式和真实运动性能仍待验证。请根据实际整机与近景渲染进行有限轮审查和修改。", "recipe": {"schema_version": "fk-robot-part-v1", "zone_sha256": "1d3b5535b1bb6d87b66a7bdf31ddcb921a1738a0d11f2a0410fa11d198f4db5c", "name": "duckling_tuft_crest", "rationale": "Revision of attempt 0, which failed because the tilted tuft and side bumps did not positively overlap the base or each other. Fix: lower the backward-leaning tuft (center Z=7.0, rotated 20 deg about Y) so its lowest swept Z is about 1 mm, inside the 2.5 mm base thickness, giving solid volume overlap; and lower the bilateral feather bumps (center Z=3.5, radius 3 mm) so each directly overlaps the base (lowest Z about 0.5 mm). Both features therefore connect to the base with positive volume, producing one fused solid. Silhouette stays a soft, friendly duckling tuft in duck-yellow PLA, well under the 35 mm zone height and far from the camera face. Mounting retention, curvature fit and print behavior remain open per the unverified interface.", "symmetry": "bilateral", "material": "pla", "color_rgb": [1.0, 0.78, 0.05], "base_size_mm": [16.0, 16.0, 2.5], "features": [{"shape": "ellipsoid", "size_mm": [18.0, 10.0, 11.0], "center_mm": [1.0, 0.0, 7.0], "rotation_deg": [0.0, 20.0, 0.0]}, {"shape": "ellipsoid", "size_mm": [6.0, 6.0, 6.0], "center_mm": [5.0, 5.5, 3.5], "rotation_deg": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0]}]}, "recipe_sha256": "0ff240bb16972265f2f6e7916359508d501171483b3dc75d4c806372e187c528", "build": {"directory": "/home/exuber/CODE/CORE/pythonProject1/AUTORESEARCH/fluxkernel/.demo/v010-personalization/robot-pal-a03ce4b3/round-00/microduck-part-d2b80ad3", "native_sha256": "f5882c4a1635022ba4a9e0ec17aa014a0e769a95e6b6016484747f492a39e937", "name": "microduck", "bodies": 16, "joints": 15, "actuators": 14, "meshes": 39, "mass_kg": 0.7392984135627633, "proof_accepted": true, "deployment_ready": false, "accepted": true, "motion_passed": true, "motion_summary": {"minimum_distance_m"